>
> Chains compose two laws, both checkable. **Soundness truncates.** A chain
> carries liveness only through its evidentiary links: the guarantee reaches
> from the grantor exactly as far as the contiguous run of links, starting at
> the holder of record, that renew on attributable evidence of the party
> beneath them; the first unconditional link ends it. Above that link the
> grantor is still protected — against that link's own death; below it, no
> party's death reaches the grantor's reclaim condition at all. The check:
> walk from each lease toward the work, and at every hop name the evidence the
